[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694430194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114389#issuecomment-3694430194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114389","id":3694430194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cNIfy","user":{"login":"skorpnok","id":6632336,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzIzMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6632336?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok","html_url":"https://github.com/skorpnok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-28T03:59:16Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T03:59:16Z","body":"Without a stacktrace it's pretty impossible to tell what is causing the segfault. Unfortunately you'll have to compile from source with dev_build=yes but that is fairly straight forward (https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/development/compiling/index.html)\n\nAs a personal guess check if your memory is running stable I've had unexplained segfaults under load due to slightly unstable memory before.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694430194/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694433978","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114389#issuecomment-3694433978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114389","id":3694433978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cNJa6","user":{"login":"Astro815","id":103153597,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiX_vQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103153597?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815","html_url":"https://github.com/Astro815","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Astro815/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-28T04:06:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T04:06:37Z","body":"I did some research and saw that Godot has indeed stopped using GLES2 as a backend.\n\nI've always tried to prioritize a lighter renderer, but it seems this is causing a conflict; that must be it.\n\nMost of my projects use the old driver: \n```\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\nrenderer/rendering_method.mobile=\"gl_compatibility\"\nquality/driver/driver_name=\"GLES2\"\nquality/driver/fallback_to_gles2=true\n```\n\nI'm going to remove \"GLES2\" and try using \"forward_plus\". I'll let you know if anything changes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694433978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694504282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114389#issuecomment-3694504282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114389","id":3694504282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cNala","user":{"login":"stdmnpkg","id":167769650,"node_id":"U_kgDOCf_2Mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167769650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg","html_url":"https://github.com/stdmnpkg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stdmnpkg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-28T06:35:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T06:35:53Z","body":"see also #110687","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3694504282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3718573654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114389#issuecomment-3718573654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/